| 001 | Heap OOB Read via Out-of-Order COLORMAP/BITSPERSAMPLE | **SKIPPED** | `tiffsplit` never calls `TIFFPrintDirectory()`; only `tiffinfo -c` reaches the vulnerable code at tif_print.c:464-470 |
| 002 | Heap OOB Read via Out-of-Order TRANSFERFUNCTION/BITSPERSAMPLE | **SKIPPED** | Same reason — `tiffsplit` has no call to `TIFFPrintDirectory()`; vulnerable path at tif_print.c:478-481 unreachable |
